OL,3,GNEWSAMurder suspect in court over
OL,4,Awoman's building fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a woman died falling from a
OL,8,Fheight in south-east London.
OL,10,FMohammed Sherif, 54, of Rowcross
OL,11,FStreet, Southwark, appeared at Croydon
OL,12,FMagistrates' Court on Tuesday accused
OL,13,Fof the murder of Kerry Ann Goodbrand,
OL,14,F31.
OL,16,FShe was found in Rowcross Street just
OL,17,Fbefore 15:00 BST on Friday and was
OL,18,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
