OL,4,Awoman's building fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FSherif appeared in the dock and spoke
OL,7,Fonly to confirm his identity. He will
OL,8,Fbe remanded into custody and will next
OL,9,Fappear at the Old Bailey on Thursday.
